// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`rewriteChangelog > reformats a fresh changesets entry to Keep-a-Changelog 1`] = `
"# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.20.0] - 2026-05-02

### Added

- New \`kigumi audit\` subcommand for theme drift detection.

### Changed

- Default Toast placement is now \`top-end\`.

### Fixed

- Tier sync race when switching from free to pro mid-run.
- Markdown component now respects sanitize prop in SSR.

### Removed

- Vestigial \`legacyImports\` config field.

## [0.19.2] - 2026-04-30

### Fixed

- Earlier release entry kept verbatim below the new one.
"
`;
